{
  "slug": "crowdstrike-falcon-fusion",
  "name": "Crowdstrike Falcon Fusion",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "CrowdStrike Falcon Fusion skills for authoring, deploying, and executing Fusion workflows. Includes live action discovery, YAML authoring with schema validation, workflow import and release, execution monitoring, and Falcon Next-Gen SIEM lookup files.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `authoring` (Discover Falcon Fusion actions via live API, author workflow YAML with correct schema, validate against Charlotte JSON schema,…), `deployment` (Import, release, and manage Falcon Fusion workflow definitions in a CID), `execution` (Trigger Falcon Fusion workflows, monitor execution status, and debug failures), `foundry-redirect` (TRIGGER when the user asks to \"build a Foundry app\", \"create a Foundry app\", mentions manifest.yml, or needs…), `lookup-files` (Manage Falcon Next-Gen SIEM lookup files (CSV/JSON/TXT) for CQL match() queries), `setup` (Configure CrowdStrike Falcon API credentials for the fusion-skills plugin), `workflows` (Orchestrates the full Falcon Fusion workflow lifecycle from discovery through deployment and execution)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install crowdstrike-falcon-fusion@claude-plugins-official` from `CrowdStrike/fusion-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "hook": 3
  },
